        {
          "_id": "64c0e7f86f5bfc7ab78ae96f",
          "previousYearPapers": [
            {
              "_id": "61a8bf0fc821b6514e527d7c",
              "examId": "615d7713c52ffa3c944600e3",
              "heldOn": "2018-04-30T09:00:00.000Z",
              "isVisible": true,
              "shortName": "2018",
              "title": "BITSAT 2018"
            }
          ],
          "type": "singleCorrect",
          "level": 3,
          "question": {
            "text": "In the context of the Hall-Heroult process for the extraction of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Al</mi></math>, which of the following statement is incorrect.",
            "image": null
          },
          "options": [
            {
              "id": "ABezA",
              "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>CO</mi></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>CO</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math> are produced in the process.",
              "isCorrect": false,
              "image": null
            },
            {
              "id": "4HASi",
              "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>Al</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></math> is mixed with <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>CaF</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math> which lowers the melting point of the mixture and brings conductivity.",
              "isCorrect": false,
              "image": null
            },
            {
              "id": "UJ0JB",
              "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>Al</mi><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup></math> is reduced at the cathode to form <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Al</mi></math>.",
              "isCorrect": false,
              "image": null
            },
            {
              "id": "M9aSH",
              "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>Na</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><msub><mi>AlF</mi><mn>6</mn></msub></math> serves as the electrolyte.",
              "isCorrect": true,
              "image": null
            }
          ],
          "correctValue": null,
          "solution": {
            "text": "<p>(i) In Hall-Heroult process for extraction of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Al</mi></math>, carbon anode is oxidised to <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>CO</mi></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>CO</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math>.</p><p>(ii) When <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>Al</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></math> is mixed with <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>CaF</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math>, it lowers the melting point of the mixture and brings conductivity.</p><p>(iii) <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>Al</mi><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup></math> is reduced at cathode to form <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Al</mi></math>.</p><p>(iv) <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>Al</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></math> serves as the electrolyte, undergoing the redox process. <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>Na</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><msub><mi>AlF</mi><mn>6</mn></msub></math> although is an electrolyte but serves as a solvent, not electrolyte.</p>",
            "image": null
          },
